WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.870
Walk through a field
and start counting.

2
00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:04.870
Huge numbers of plants.

3
00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:07.570
Far fewer animals that
eat those plants.

4
00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.830
Fewer still that eat those animals.

5
00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:12.870
And at the top, perhaps one hunter.

6
00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:15.990
Food chains stop after
only a few links.

7
00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:17.770
Why can't they keep on going?

8
00:00:17.820 --> 00:00:21.350
In this mission, you'll find out
how much food passes from one

9
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.810
trophic level to the next,
and what happens to the rest.

10
00:00:24.860 --> 00:00:27.950
You'll compare biomass
and energy at each level.

11
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.230
And you'll see why pyramids of
biomass get narrower towards the

12
00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:33.290
top.

13
00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:37.290
Your mission: find out why
food chains are so short.
